## Check harness build output
# CheckLua is compiled from tests/harness/CheckLua.java on demand, and the list
# of Lua files it is handed is written next to it.
tests/build/

## IDE / editor cruft
.idea/
.vscode/
.vs/
*.iml
*.code-workspace
*.swp
*~

## OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

## Logs and crash artefacts, wherever they land
*.log
hs_err_pid*.log
logs/

###############################################################################
# Local-only reference material. NOT for publication.
#
# original-mods/ holds the upstream mods as they were before this fork, plus an
# unrelated mod of the author's kept as a style reference. It is what the checks
# in tests/README.md calibrate against: run them over that folder and they
# report the problems this fork was written to fix. None of it needs to ship,
# and one of the mods in there asks not to be re-uploaded, so it stays local.
#
# context-files/ are screenshots taken while working.
#
# example-script-*.lua are the author's own scripts from an unrelated project,
# kept as a style reference only.
#
# Remove an entry only if you deliberately intend to publish it.
# See NOTICE and LICENSE.
###############################################################################
original-mods/
context-files/
example-script-*.lua
NOTES.md
